WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:41.080
Gold mine?

01:42.760 --> 01:43.600
Hurry up.

01:45.720 --> 01:47.000
The Xue family's three members.

01:50.000 --> 01:50.880
Shen Yurong.

01:51.440 --> 01:52.400
Eldest Princess.

01:53.320 --> 01:54.920
It turns out all these are related.

01:55.400 --> 01:56.240
So

01:57.480 --> 02:00.280
do you know
what consequence you're facing?

02:01.000 --> 02:02.280
What consequence can there be?

02:05.560 --> 02:07.560
Didn't they kill everyone?

02:07.640 --> 02:09.199
- You're right.
- You keep dilly-dallying.

02:11.440 --> 02:13.440
We should walk around
or we might get suspected.

02:16.800 --> 02:17.800
Be quick.

02:19.840 --> 02:20.840
Hurry up!

02:20.920 --> 02:22.040
You move the slowest.

02:22.120 --> 02:23.320
Didn't you have breakfast?

02:25.000 --> 02:25.880
Hurry up!

02:32.320 --> 02:33.320
Come on, you two!

02:35.080 --> 02:36.400
- Gu Er.
- Hurry! What are you doing?

02:36.480 --> 02:38.520
What are you doing? It's an easy task.

02:38.600 --> 02:39.960
- I'll kill you!
- Stop it.

02:40.040 --> 02:40.880
Get out of the way.

02:40.960 --> 02:42.760
- Stop it.
- Do you want me to hit you too?

02:42.840 --> 02:43.760
- Sir.
- I'll hit you too!

02:43.840 --> 02:44.720
- Stop!
- I'll kill you!

02:44.800 --> 02:46.120
Don't hit my brother!

02:46.200 --> 02:47.400
You won't move out of the way?

02:47.480 --> 02:49.000
- I'll hit you too!
- Sir.

02:49.720 --> 02:50.960
- Gu Er.
- Stop.

02:51.040 --> 02:51.880
I'll kill you!

02:51.960 --> 02:52.920
- Stop it.
- I'll kill you.

02:53.440 --> 02:54.840
There are fewer workers than before.

02:54.920 --> 02:56.520
Who will work if we kill them? Calm down.

02:57.360 --> 02:58.560
Consider yourselves lucky.

02:58.640 --> 03:00.360
Dress your wounds, then come back to work.

03:00.440 --> 03:01.280
- Scram! Hurry!
- Let's go.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.760
You won't eat anything
if you're back late!

03:02.840 --> 03:04.760
What are you looking at?

03:04.840 --> 03:05.680
Let's go.

03:07.080 --> 03:08.480
Did you all see it?

03:09.040 --> 03:10.720
If you dare to slack off,

03:10.800 --> 03:12.160
you will be like them.

03:12.240 --> 03:14.800
- Stop looking. Get to work.
- Hurry, what are you doing? Be quick!

03:32.800 --> 03:33.640
Bear with it a bit.

03:37.080 --> 03:39.600
Tell me. Are we going to die here?

03:41.600 --> 03:44.360
Don't talk nonsense. We'll be fine.

04:00.480 --> 04:01.320
Who is there?

04:09.320 --> 04:10.680
The foreman said

04:10.760 --> 04:12.400
we could go back
after dressing our wounds.

04:15.360 --> 04:16.880
Stay over there. Don't force us.

04:29.640 --> 04:30.560
Gu Da.

04:30.640 --> 04:31.640
Gu Er.

04:32.160 --> 04:33.200
It's me.

04:34.520 --> 04:36.160
Xue Li?

04:38.560 --> 04:39.640
It's Xue Li.

04:41.680 --> 04:42.640
It's me.

04:43.200 --> 04:44.120
Are you really Xue Li?

04:45.760 --> 04:46.880
I'm here to save you.

04:49.400 --> 04:50.400
Sorry for all of this.

04:50.480 --> 04:52.320
But didn't they say that

04:52.400 --> 04:53.880
you had an accident on your way back?

04:53.960 --> 04:55.960
- How did…
- It's a long story.

04:56.920 --> 04:58.480
I have a new identity now.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.400
My name is Jiang Li.

05:00.080 --> 05:00.920
Jiang Li?

05:01.520 --> 05:02.760
From now on, don't call me

05:03.440 --> 05:05.000
by my old name in front of outsiders.

05:06.240 --> 05:08.120
Get out first and I'll tell you in detail.

05:08.920 --> 05:10.000
It's heavily guarded here.

05:10.760 --> 05:12.400
It's not that easy to escape.

05:12.480 --> 05:14.520
He's right. Xue Li, just go.

05:14.600 --> 05:15.840
Even if we escape,

05:15.920 --> 05:18.240
that bastard Feng Yutang
won't let us get away with it.

05:18.320 --> 05:20.080
- Yes, go.
- I'm not leaving.

05:20.160 --> 05:21.320
I'm not leaving.

05:21.880 --> 05:22.840
Don't worry.

05:23.360 --> 05:25.880
Feng Yutang's happy days are almost over.

05:26.600 --> 05:27.520
Now that I've come in,

05:28.120 --> 05:29.520
I must take you out.

05:32.320 --> 05:33.680
Let's go over there and check.

05:33.760 --> 05:35.400
- See if anyone's slacking off.
- All right.

05:52.280 --> 05:54.440
- Don't be scared. He's one of us.
- Someone is coming.

06:09.040 --> 06:10.320
Are you knocking me to death?

06:13.200 --> 06:14.680
Behave yourselves and work hard.

06:16.080 --> 06:17.560
My brother told you

06:17.640 --> 06:18.560
to work faster.

06:21.000 --> 06:22.400
What's going on with you today?

06:23.640 --> 06:24.560
Work hard.

06:27.080 --> 06:28.560
Wait for me.

07:14.840 --> 07:15.920
Aren't you going to eat?

07:16.000 --> 07:17.760
- Do you want to starve me to death?
- No.

07:50.560 --> 07:51.480
Where are they?

07:52.640 --> 07:54.000
I saw them come in.

08:14.680 --> 08:15.520
Xue…

08:16.640 --> 08:17.520
Jiang Li.

08:18.240 --> 08:19.560
We thought it over.

08:19.640 --> 08:21.120
You're so brave to come to our rescue.

08:21.200 --> 08:22.320
Why won't we dare to go out?

08:23.120 --> 08:23.960
It's just that

08:24.680 --> 08:26.800
He Jun and Peng Xiao are also here.

08:26.880 --> 08:28.680
Are He Jun and Peng Xiao still alive?

08:28.760 --> 08:30.800
We will call them.

08:30.880 --> 08:31.840
Be careful.

08:32.919 --> 08:34.000
Don't give the game away.

08:34.080 --> 08:34.960
Don't worry.

08:35.960 --> 08:36.799
- Let's go.
- Come on.

08:49.280 --> 08:50.440
Keep up.

08:51.200 --> 08:52.040
Hurry up.

08:53.920 --> 08:54.840
This way.

08:56.600 --> 08:58.360
- All right, go.
- After dinner,

08:58.440 --> 08:59.760
another shift will take over.

08:59.840 --> 09:00.840
Here you go.

09:00.920 --> 09:02.200
- We'll take this opportunity
- Come on.

09:02.280 --> 09:04.680
- to escape with Peng Xiao and He Jun.
- All right, that's all.

09:05.200 --> 09:06.080
- Gu Da.
- Go.

09:06.560 --> 09:08.840
- He Jun and Peng Xiao are over there.
- What are you doing? Hurry.

09:10.120 --> 09:10.960
Let's go.

09:14.040 --> 09:14.920
Yours.

09:15.880 --> 09:17.320
There's no time to explain. Let's go.

09:19.320 --> 09:20.160
Go.

09:25.160 --> 09:26.200
Your shoulders are shaking.

09:28.040 --> 09:28.960
You're mistaken.

09:30.560 --> 09:32.200
As someone you dragged into this,

09:32.280 --> 09:33.880
I need to remind you.

09:33.960 --> 09:35.160
This operation is too risky.

09:35.720 --> 09:39.040
With your intelligence,
you can wait until I destroy this place

09:39.120 --> 09:40.120
and enjoy the benefits.

09:40.200 --> 09:41.080
Why not do that?

09:41.720 --> 09:44.840
By the time you gather sufficient evidence
and send troops to seize the gold mine,

09:45.440 --> 09:47.360
Magistrate Xue would have been beheaded.

09:49.280 --> 09:50.120
Come here.

10:08.840 --> 10:09.680
This is bad.

10:10.560 --> 10:12.360
They don't know
the inspectors are approaching.

10:12.440 --> 10:13.400
We have to go back.

10:14.560 --> 10:15.400
Follow me.

10:29.440 --> 10:30.560
- Quick, hide.
- Come on.

10:42.840 --> 10:43.720
Gu Er.

10:47.800 --> 10:48.640
Be quiet.

10:48.720 --> 10:49.600
Calm down.

10:50.080 --> 10:51.760
If worse comes to worst, we'll fight them.

10:51.840 --> 10:52.680
You're right.

10:53.160 --> 10:55.720
There are four of us.
Should we be afraid of the two of them?

11:07.960 --> 11:10.200
I feel like sleeping when I'm full.

11:10.680 --> 11:12.080
All you do is eat and sleep.

11:21.240 --> 11:22.600
Help! There's a problem!

11:22.680 --> 11:23.600
Help!

11:24.080 --> 11:25.600
We're in trouble! Help!

11:25.680 --> 11:27.360
Help! There's a problem!

11:36.960 --> 11:39.200
- Step back.
- Over there. Catch them!

12:28.320 --> 12:29.480
My lord, go first.

12:29.560 --> 12:30.480
Come back alive.

12:30.560 --> 12:31.400
Yes.

12:36.520 --> 12:37.360
Let's go.

12:39.080 --> 12:39.920
Come on.

13:01.160 --> 13:02.440
You can't even watch someone.

13:04.040 --> 13:05.200
You even let him run away.

13:05.280 --> 13:07.360
What's the use
of keeping useless people like you?

13:07.440 --> 13:08.520
Magistrate, rest assured.

13:08.600 --> 13:10.560
We're searching
the whole city for Ye Mingyu.

13:11.200 --> 13:12.600
He won't be able to leave Huaixiang.

13:13.280 --> 13:14.160
Rest assured?

13:14.960 --> 13:16.000
Rest assured?

13:16.080 --> 13:17.440
Have you ever let me feel assured?

13:18.200 --> 13:19.160
Magistrate, please calm down.

13:19.240 --> 13:21.400
During our search,

13:21.480 --> 13:25.160
we found a spy

13:25.800 --> 13:26.800
in the government office.

14:07.720 --> 14:11.440
Xue Huaiyuan took you in back then.

14:12.080 --> 14:15.760
To return the favor,
you're even willing to die.

14:15.840 --> 14:17.840
I didn't expect
that there would be someone

14:19.080 --> 14:21.680
as kind and righteous as you
here in the government office.

14:23.480 --> 14:24.480
And look at all of you.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.200
A pack of lackeys.

14:27.680 --> 14:29.080
Maybe one day,

14:29.840 --> 14:31.680
you will sell me out for money.

14:37.200 --> 14:38.280
There's just one thing

14:38.960 --> 14:40.840
I can't figure out.

14:42.960 --> 14:47.680
I took you in
after Xue Huaiyuan fell from power.

14:48.360 --> 14:50.680
I am your benefactor too.

14:50.760 --> 14:52.360
Why did you betray me?

14:52.960 --> 14:53.800
Crook!

14:54.920 --> 14:57.080
You don't deserve
to be compared with Magistrate Xue.

15:05.080 --> 15:07.680
I really thought you were mute.

15:08.200 --> 15:09.840
Since you are not mute,

15:10.840 --> 15:11.760
tell me.

15:14.080 --> 15:18.840
Is Jiang Li Xue Fangfei?

15:18.920 --> 15:19.840
Where is she?

15:20.560 --> 15:23.320
What did you two talk about?

15:28.080 --> 15:32.960
If you still don't tell me, I'll be angry.

15:34.040 --> 15:34.880
Fine.

15:36.520 --> 15:37.360
I'll tell you.

15:44.320 --> 15:47.360
She told me that day that…

15:49.840 --> 15:51.960
Die, you crook!

16:07.680 --> 16:08.960
Bring Guaiguai here.

16:09.840 --> 16:11.840
He hasn't eaten meat for days.

16:13.720 --> 16:15.280
This one is enough for a good feed.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.760
This hag

16:17.840 --> 16:20.400
has only uttered a few words in her life.

16:20.480 --> 16:21.440
This time,

16:22.200 --> 16:23.840
let her scream.

17:11.400 --> 17:12.240
My lord.

17:12.720 --> 17:14.319
Get in the carriage. I'll deal with this.

17:14.400 --> 17:16.319
- Lu Ji is still behind us. Go and help.
- Yes.

17:18.359 --> 17:20.160
- Come.
- Get in.

17:24.560 --> 17:25.760
- Follow me.
- All right.

17:35.520 --> 17:36.560
Reporting!

17:39.560 --> 17:40.440
Reporting.

17:40.520 --> 17:42.480
Magistrate,
there's a report from the mine.

17:42.560 --> 17:44.640
Some miners were rescued.

17:46.760 --> 17:49.320
So their goal is the gold mine.

17:55.320 --> 17:57.080
Are there any letters from the higher-ups?

17:57.720 --> 17:58.640
Not yet.

17:59.640 --> 18:00.560
Not yet?

18:01.080 --> 18:02.080
- Magistrate!
- Not yet?

18:02.160 --> 18:04.280
- Not yet? Always not yet.
- Please spare me, Magistrate.

18:04.360 --> 18:05.680
- Why not?
- Please spare me, Magistrate.

18:05.760 --> 18:06.640
Get out!

18:07.400 --> 18:09.040
Magistrate, there is a pigeon post

18:09.560 --> 18:10.400
from the capital.

18:25.240 --> 18:28.120
Since someone will support me
no matter what happens,

18:29.360 --> 18:32.280
I don't have anything to worry about.

18:33.600 --> 18:36.160
If you dare to challenge me
on my home ground,

18:37.320 --> 18:40.080
I will make sure you never go out alive.

19:09.880 --> 19:11.520
There's an ambush.
Get out of the carriage!

21:16.080 --> 21:17.320
Xiao Heng!

21:39.560 --> 21:40.920
Lu Ji, protect Li!

21:41.000 --> 21:41.840
Yes!

22:31.360 --> 22:32.840
- Are you all right?
- Are you all right?

22:54.360 --> 22:56.440
My lord, the wound is dressed.

22:56.520 --> 22:57.520
Try to move it.

23:04.920 --> 23:05.800
Stop.

23:06.720 --> 23:07.560
Lower your head.

23:25.840 --> 23:26.720
Does it hurt?

23:30.160 --> 23:31.040
It's fine now.

23:31.520 --> 23:33.600
- What about you?
- You protected me.

23:34.600 --> 23:35.520
I'm fine.

23:37.560 --> 23:38.960
I also got it bandaged just now.

23:40.600 --> 23:41.440
Li.

23:42.400 --> 23:43.920
You don't always have to be brave.

23:47.600 --> 23:49.080
My life is yours now.

23:51.240 --> 23:53.040
Did you hear me?

23:53.520 --> 23:54.360
I did.

23:54.440 --> 23:55.960
But it means little.

23:56.040 --> 23:57.560
You haven't accomplished what you want.

23:57.640 --> 23:59.480
If I take your life now,

23:59.560 --> 24:00.520
will you agree?

24:06.000 --> 24:07.680
Then I'll do my best
not to look for trouble

24:08.600 --> 24:10.000
before you deal with me.

24:10.080 --> 24:10.920
It's all right.

24:11.560 --> 24:13.280
No one believes anything you say.

24:15.840 --> 24:16.680
Duke Su.

24:19.720 --> 24:22.640
Please feel free to use me as a pawn.

24:23.200 --> 24:24.320
I, Jiang Li,

24:25.080 --> 24:26.280
always await your instructions.

24:36.680 --> 24:37.840
What does this mean?

24:37.920 --> 24:39.000
This handkerchief is torn.

24:39.080 --> 24:40.040
So

24:40.840 --> 24:41.880
do you want me to mend it?

24:41.960 --> 24:44.240
Why? Is there a problem?

24:44.320 --> 24:45.160
No.

24:46.360 --> 24:48.040
I'm glad to be at your service, Duke Su.

24:50.280 --> 24:51.120
My lord.

24:51.600 --> 24:52.800
We cleaned up the battlefield.

24:52.880 --> 24:53.880
Let's go to the government office.

24:54.840 --> 24:55.960
I'll go with you.

24:57.280 --> 24:58.840
We're going to arrest someone.

24:58.920 --> 25:00.120
It's inappropriate for you to go.

25:00.200 --> 25:01.200
I'll stay on the side.

25:01.280 --> 25:02.320
I won't cause any trouble.

25:03.720 --> 25:06.680
Magistrate Xue may still be
in Feng Yutang's hands.

25:11.120 --> 25:12.840
Go back and get her some decent clothes.

25:12.920 --> 25:13.840
Yes.

25:14.800 --> 25:16.400
It's a reunion after a long separation.

25:17.160 --> 25:18.720
Don't be covered in dirt.

25:27.800 --> 25:32.920
HUAIXIANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

25:46.920 --> 25:47.760
Eat.

25:52.800 --> 25:53.680
Magistrate Feng.

25:53.760 --> 25:54.920
Shall we wait

25:55.000 --> 25:56.760
for their triumphant return
and dine together?

25:56.840 --> 25:58.840
Triumphant return?

26:00.040 --> 26:02.000
They would've returned long ago
if they triumphed.

26:04.480 --> 26:06.160
I shouldn't have believed Li Jin.

26:08.520 --> 26:11.280
How can Duke Su be killed

26:11.360 --> 26:12.480
by my useless men?

26:14.080 --> 26:15.320
Perhaps

26:15.400 --> 26:17.040
the bodies of those useless men

26:17.120 --> 26:18.880
are on their way back.

26:20.040 --> 26:21.480
Then let's get the carriage ready.

26:22.840 --> 26:23.760
Where are we going?

26:24.240 --> 26:26.240
Run away with our tails between our legs?

26:27.160 --> 26:28.400
And go back to being beggars?

26:29.400 --> 26:30.600
I will never do that!

26:31.120 --> 26:33.040
I'm already in this position.

26:33.120 --> 26:35.560
They can't let me be like a dog again!

26:45.560 --> 26:46.560
What are you waiting for?

26:46.640 --> 26:48.720
Keep playing music. Keep eating.

27:07.840 --> 27:13.120
HUAIXIANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

27:17.080 --> 27:18.480
Are they surrendering?

27:18.560 --> 27:19.840
There's even music playing inside.

27:19.920 --> 27:21.880
Are they celebrating because they thought

27:21.960 --> 27:22.800
we were all dead?

27:23.520 --> 27:25.160
Beware of them clutching at straws.

27:36.840 --> 27:38.240
You are back.

27:39.120 --> 27:40.400
The trip must be strenuous.

27:40.880 --> 27:42.000
Have a seat.

27:42.080 --> 27:43.520
We've prepared roasted lamb for you.

27:43.600 --> 27:45.040
Come on. Have some food.

27:45.120 --> 27:46.000
Magistrate Feng.

27:46.080 --> 27:46.920
Forget the food.

27:48.560 --> 27:50.480
Let's talk about
the gold mine in East Mountain.

27:51.400 --> 27:53.200
So you also like gold.

27:53.280 --> 27:54.120
No problem.

27:54.600 --> 27:55.800
Give me a quote.

27:55.880 --> 27:57.080
Forget about a sack of gold.

27:57.560 --> 27:58.720
I can give you the whole mine.

27:58.800 --> 28:00.680
What a glib talker. Come!

28:00.760 --> 28:02.560
Arrest all these people

28:02.640 --> 28:04.400
who are stealing gold
from the imperial court!

28:04.480 --> 28:05.440
Wait.

28:07.360 --> 28:08.640
What's the hurry?

28:16.080 --> 28:16.920
Xue Li.

28:36.280 --> 28:37.320
If you want to arrest me,

28:37.400 --> 28:40.520
you have to ask
whether Magistrate Xue agrees.

28:42.080 --> 28:43.760
- Xue Li.
- Magistrate Xue.

28:44.720 --> 28:47.120
We've been living high on the hog.

28:47.200 --> 28:49.000
- Xue Li.
- I'm so nice to you

28:49.080 --> 28:51.440
- Xue Li.
- and these people want to arrest me.

28:52.400 --> 28:54.160
What should I do?

28:56.160 --> 28:57.080
Jiang Li.

28:59.760 --> 29:00.600
Damn you!

29:01.080 --> 29:02.040
Feng Yutang!

29:02.120 --> 29:03.480
You're a man.

29:03.560 --> 29:05.640
How can you threaten people
with a demented old man?

29:06.360 --> 29:07.480
Xue.

29:08.120 --> 29:10.600
It seems like we got the wrong person.

29:10.680 --> 29:14.080
Your daughter wouldn't leave you
in the lurch, would she?

29:15.000 --> 29:17.640
My carriage is parked in the front yard.

29:17.720 --> 29:18.840
So?

29:19.560 --> 29:23.760
Duke Su, fill my carriage with gold.

29:24.640 --> 29:26.920
Then I will leave quietly.

29:27.000 --> 29:27.840
Xue Li.

29:27.920 --> 29:30.000
But if I feel threatened

29:30.080 --> 29:32.600
and afraid along the way,

29:33.680 --> 29:35.080
my hand

29:35.760 --> 29:37.320
may have a mind of its own.

29:37.880 --> 29:38.800
Feng Yutang.

29:38.880 --> 29:40.200
You must be out of your mind.

29:40.280 --> 29:41.960
The gold mine case is a big one

29:42.040 --> 29:43.840
and you think you can
kidnap someone and get away?

29:43.920 --> 29:45.280
You even dare to demand money.

29:45.360 --> 29:47.280
What I think doesn't matter.

29:47.360 --> 29:49.720
It's Duke Su's opinion that matters.

29:49.800 --> 29:51.680
But hurry up.

29:51.760 --> 29:53.160
We're running out of time.

29:53.240 --> 29:54.280
Jiang Li.

29:54.360 --> 29:55.200
Xue Li.

29:57.560 --> 29:58.520
Xue Li.

30:01.360 --> 30:02.200
Xue Li.

30:04.720 --> 30:05.560
Xue Li.

30:05.640 --> 30:06.800
You have my word.

30:09.240 --> 30:10.080
Lu Ji.

30:11.200 --> 30:12.240
Load up the carriage.

30:19.760 --> 30:21.200
Xue Li.

30:32.840 --> 30:33.680
Done.

30:35.000 --> 30:35.840
Make way.

30:50.800 --> 30:51.640
Xue Li.

31:04.840 --> 31:05.920
Xue Li.

31:07.880 --> 31:10.760
Mr. Xue, it's all thanks to you.

31:17.320 --> 31:18.160
Xue Li.

31:35.120 --> 31:36.160
Do you believe in me?

31:43.360 --> 31:44.400
I do.

31:54.320 --> 31:55.160
Move it.

32:45.560 --> 32:46.840
Killing…

32:47.520 --> 32:48.400
Kill…

32:50.560 --> 32:51.400
Not good.

32:51.480 --> 32:52.320
Father.

32:52.880 --> 32:54.200
Killing is not good.

32:54.920 --> 32:55.760
Father.

33:04.840 --> 33:05.760
Get up!

33:11.160 --> 33:12.160
Well done.

33:12.240 --> 33:13.440
Thank you, my lord.

33:27.280 --> 33:29.400
You double-crossed me.

33:29.480 --> 33:30.520
Aren't you fierce?

33:35.440 --> 33:38.360
You're one to talk.

33:38.440 --> 33:41.080
I'm not as good at winning
people's support as you are.

33:42.080 --> 33:45.000
I just pity people
who have sacrificed their lives for you.

33:46.320 --> 33:49.240
They come to a sticky end.

33:49.320 --> 33:50.360
Mute Granny.

33:54.360 --> 33:55.800
What happened to Mute Granny?

33:55.880 --> 33:58.880
Go ask the dog at the door.

33:59.520 --> 34:02.240
It's on a full stomach.

34:09.320 --> 34:10.199
Duke Su.

34:12.239 --> 34:13.639
Can you give him the antidote first?

34:14.440 --> 34:15.280
Dying like this

34:15.360 --> 34:16.320
is too easy for him.

34:16.880 --> 34:18.000
He won't die.

34:18.080 --> 34:19.040
It's a big case.

34:20.120 --> 34:21.639
I need him alive.

34:21.719 --> 34:24.639
Ministry of Justice officials will be here
tomorrow to witness the execution.

34:26.960 --> 34:28.800
I don't believe you'd dare to let me die.

34:29.960 --> 34:33.120
Hellcat, I know it's you.

34:33.600 --> 34:37.000
When your father,
Xue Huaiyuan, dies tomorrow,

34:37.600 --> 34:39.840
I'll be the first to send you to hell
so you can join him.

34:41.440 --> 34:42.280
Uncle Mingyu.

34:43.760 --> 34:44.639
Your knife.

34:51.000 --> 34:51.880
Come on.

35:00.280 --> 35:01.280
This one

35:02.960 --> 35:04.720
is for Magistrate Xue and Xue Zhao.

35:07.880 --> 35:09.480
You can't defeat me.

35:09.560 --> 35:12.040
Just wait until your father is beheaded.

35:15.920 --> 35:17.480
This is for Mute Granny.

35:17.560 --> 35:18.960
You cow.

35:19.040 --> 35:20.160
I am going to kill you.

35:21.360 --> 35:24.640
And this is
for all the officers you persecuted.

35:25.840 --> 35:26.680
Nutcase.

35:28.320 --> 35:31.560
This is for all the people in Huaixiang.

35:36.880 --> 35:38.040
Spare me.

35:38.120 --> 35:39.280
Miss, have mercy.

35:39.880 --> 35:40.880
Die!

35:41.760 --> 35:42.960
Miss, please spare me.

35:51.160 --> 35:52.040
And this one

35:53.720 --> 35:55.080
is for Qiong Zhi.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.320
Stop the bleeding.

36:07.840 --> 36:08.720
Keep him alive.

36:22.960 --> 36:24.880
HUAIXIANG GOVERNMENT OFFICE

36:26.680 --> 36:27.720
Let them go.

36:28.520 --> 36:29.440
You can't catch them.

37:25.600 --> 37:26.440
Fear not.

37:26.520 --> 37:27.560
Don't be afraid. It's me.

37:28.960 --> 37:29.920
It's me.

37:36.600 --> 37:37.440
It's dangerous.

37:37.520 --> 37:38.360
It's not.

37:38.440 --> 37:40.360
- It's dangerous.
- No. Father, there's no one but me.

37:42.320 --> 37:44.960
Xue Li.

37:46.560 --> 37:47.400
I'm here.

37:47.480 --> 37:48.320
Xue Li.

37:48.800 --> 37:50.200
Father, I'm here.

37:50.280 --> 37:51.120
Xue Li.

37:51.760 --> 37:52.640
I'm here.

37:56.640 --> 37:57.480
Xue Li?

37:58.760 --> 37:59.600
Xue Li.

38:03.360 --> 38:04.200
Xue Li.

38:05.520 --> 38:06.360
Xue Li.

38:06.440 --> 38:07.280
It's dangerous.

38:07.760 --> 38:08.600
- Father.
- Xue Li.

38:09.760 --> 38:11.680
- Xue Li.
- Father.

38:12.240 --> 38:14.040
- Xue Li.
- Father, come to your senses.

38:14.120 --> 38:15.120
- Father.
- Xue Li.

38:18.040 --> 38:19.480
Xue Li, don't cry.

38:21.240 --> 38:23.440
Xue Li, don't cry.

38:24.440 --> 38:25.320
Xue Li.

38:26.880 --> 38:27.760
Don't cry.

38:35.560 --> 38:36.400
Xue Li.

38:39.720 --> 38:41.200
I'm sorry, Father.

38:42.480 --> 38:43.320
Don't cry.

38:43.800 --> 38:44.760
I'm sorry.

38:46.840 --> 38:47.760
Don't cry.

38:47.840 --> 38:49.640
- I came back late.
- Don't.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.760
I will save you.

38:53.040 --> 38:54.560
I will overturn the verdict.

38:55.200 --> 38:56.040
Xue Li.

38:56.120 --> 38:58.400
- Everyone who harmed us
- Don't cry.

38:58.480 --> 39:00.040
won't get away with it.

39:01.120 --> 39:02.480
None of them will get away.

39:03.720 --> 39:04.560
All right?

39:04.640 --> 39:05.680
Don't cry.

39:06.920 --> 39:07.840
It's all right now.

39:10.920 --> 39:11.760
It's all right.

39:13.440 --> 39:14.400
Xue Li.

39:33.000 --> 39:33.920
Duke Su.

39:37.320 --> 39:38.280
Why are you here?

39:39.280 --> 39:40.120
I'm waiting for you.

39:40.200 --> 39:43.120
- What's wrong? Did something happen?
- Nothing.

39:43.200 --> 39:44.320
Relax.

39:44.880 --> 39:47.400
I don't want to get anyone
into trouble anymore.

39:47.480 --> 39:50.480
Your people went to find witnesses who can
help Xue Huaiyuan overturn the verdict.

39:50.560 --> 39:52.160
I'll let you know if they find anything.

39:52.720 --> 39:53.600
All right.

40:06.440 --> 40:07.360
Cowards!

40:08.120 --> 40:10.000
They showed no hesitation
when receiving benefits

40:10.080 --> 40:11.320
from Magistrate Xue before.

40:12.360 --> 40:14.640
Darn it. I'll go this time.

40:14.720 --> 40:16.360
If they won't come, I will make them come.

40:16.440 --> 40:17.280
Cut it out.

40:18.480 --> 40:21.000
You are not them.
You can't understand their difficulties.

40:21.080 --> 40:21.960
Understand them?

40:22.720 --> 40:24.560
Did they understand
Magistrate Xue's situation?

40:24.640 --> 40:26.880
Are we going to sit by
and watch Magistrate Xue be--

40:31.600 --> 40:32.560
What's wrong?

40:35.200 --> 40:36.360
What exactly is going on?

40:39.680 --> 40:40.920
We don't know anything

40:42.560 --> 40:43.760
about Magistrate Xue.

40:45.240 --> 40:46.560
We are just ordinary people.

40:47.960 --> 40:49.560
Let's just listen to the authorities.

40:49.640 --> 40:50.680
How can you not know?

40:51.480 --> 40:52.680
Without Magistrate Xue's aid,

40:53.200 --> 40:55.280
how could Ping'an
be alive and healthy now?

40:58.240 --> 40:59.200
Isn't this enough

40:59.280 --> 41:00.640
for you to speak up

41:01.120 --> 41:02.600
for the magistrate?

41:05.880 --> 41:06.800
During the New Year,

41:06.880 --> 41:08.600
I wanted to visit Magistrate Xue in prison

41:09.560 --> 41:11.280
and give him some dumplings.

41:11.360 --> 41:14.360
But in the blink of an eye,
they took Ping'an away.

41:14.440 --> 41:15.320
Look.

41:15.880 --> 41:17.400
Look how they hit Ping'an.

41:20.600 --> 41:22.680
I only have Ping'an now.

41:22.760 --> 41:23.760
Feng Yutang is dead.

41:24.360 --> 41:27.160
- You don't have to be afraid.
- Everybody should mind their own business.

41:27.240 --> 41:28.520
I beg of you.

41:28.600 --> 41:30.920
Let us live a peaceful life.

41:31.000 --> 41:32.400
I've let Magistrate Xue down.

41:32.480 --> 41:33.640
I failed Magistrate Xue.

41:35.040 --> 41:35.960
I can't do it.

41:37.200 --> 41:38.120
I can't.

41:39.920 --> 41:40.960
What a coward.

41:41.440 --> 41:43.280
Now, I know.

41:43.360 --> 41:44.760
What did your mother say?

41:45.280 --> 41:47.240
- You ingrate forgot all about it!
- Enough already!

41:51.760 --> 41:54.240
I wanted to redress the injustices
for Magistrate Xue.

41:56.640 --> 41:58.360
I submitted a petition at once
when I learned

41:59.080 --> 42:00.840
that Magistrate Xue was convicted.

42:01.680 --> 42:02.880
But the new magistrate

42:05.360 --> 42:07.560
beat my mother so badly
that she was bedridden for months.

42:09.680 --> 42:11.360
Feng Yutang is dead.

42:12.200 --> 42:13.760
Why are you still afraid of him?

42:13.840 --> 42:15.680
We are just ordinary people.

42:17.080 --> 42:19.160
We only want to live our lives well.

42:19.240 --> 42:21.080
I, Wenxuan, can only repay

42:21.160 --> 42:22.240
Magistrate Xue's kindness

42:23.520 --> 42:25.160
in my next life.

42:28.000 --> 42:30.200
Zhang, if even you won't go,

42:30.280 --> 42:31.560
no one will dare to come forward.

42:35.680 --> 42:38.320
When they confiscated
Magistrate Xue's Residence,

42:39.080 --> 42:39.920
I went there.

42:40.400 --> 42:41.240
How did it end?

42:41.960 --> 42:43.920
They blinded my eye.

42:44.520 --> 42:46.440
I don't want to lose another eye.

42:47.640 --> 42:48.800
We went to several

42:48.880 --> 42:50.200
of the villagers' homes.

42:50.280 --> 42:52.960
Butcher Zhang, Dai Yun, and Mo Wenxuan.

42:54.080 --> 42:55.120
They…

42:55.200 --> 42:56.080
Got it.

42:57.720 --> 42:59.320
Go home first.

43:00.640 --> 43:01.480
Thank you.

43:01.560 --> 43:04.680
How about we go ask someone else?

43:04.760 --> 43:05.600
Right.

43:06.760 --> 43:08.360
Magistrate Xue is kindhearted.

43:09.720 --> 43:11.000
The heavens will surely help him.

43:11.480 --> 43:14.800
For sure, one good turn deserves another.

43:35.600 --> 43:36.760
Madam Chunfang.

43:38.000 --> 43:38.840
It's me.

43:39.400 --> 43:41.840
I'm Fangfei,
whom you have known since I was a kid.

43:47.120 --> 43:48.160
Xue Li.

43:49.160 --> 43:50.320
It's really you.

43:51.200 --> 43:52.880
You are still alive.

43:53.560 --> 43:54.520
Madam Chunfang.

43:56.160 --> 43:57.880
My father will be beheaded tomorrow.

43:59.120 --> 44:02.240
I would like you
to speak out in his defense.

44:06.600 --> 44:07.440
Close the door.

44:09.320 --> 44:10.160
Madam Chunfang.

44:12.680 --> 44:13.520
Madam Chunfang.

44:16.320 --> 44:17.280
Madam Chunfang.

44:18.680 --> 44:19.520
Please.

44:20.920 --> 44:21.880
I beg of you.

44:25.760 --> 44:26.720
Please.

44:27.360 --> 44:28.200
I beg of you.

44:28.280 --> 44:29.200
Xue Li.

44:29.280 --> 44:30.680
- Please.
- Good girl.

44:31.560 --> 44:33.600
Stand up. Don't kneel.

44:36.440 --> 44:37.360
Your hand…

44:39.280 --> 44:40.320
They did this, didn't they?

44:41.760 --> 44:42.800
Did they do this to you?

44:45.600 --> 44:46.440
Come back now!

44:58.320 --> 44:59.200
Mr. Liu's leg…

45:03.040 --> 45:08.440
Xue Li, think of us as cowards.

45:08.520 --> 45:09.760
Just consider us…

45:11.160 --> 45:12.360
dead.

45:32.520 --> 45:33.840
Can doing good deeds

45:35.000 --> 45:37.000
really lead to good karma?
